{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のぷっすま"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てもらえましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Berryz工房さんvs乃木坂46で激辛部オーディションを受けてきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて辛いもの食べて、どうなるかなと思ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体がプルプル震えてしまいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/01/1158662/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ちは大丈夫だったんですけどね(・∀・。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Berryz工房さんの根性には衝撃を受けましたし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"草剪さん、ユースケさんもとても優しくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当におもしろかった♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂メンバーは負けてしまいましたが、精一杯がんばれたのでよかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/01/1158662/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌も歌えたし(^w^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"急に振られたのでオペラは思いつかず"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校で歌ったWe are the world を歌ってみましたがいかがでしたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日からパルコ劇場で公演が始まりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までにない内容で緊張の中、みんな一丸となって努力しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1幕はオーディション"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2幕はそれを受けての「アリス」をモチーフにしたミュージカル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日私は第一部、第二部ともにアリス役に選んでいただきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"びっくりしました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な役をやらせていただき本当にありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂のオーディションを受ける時に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜグループを受けるのかと聞かれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆と舞台で踊ったり歌ったりするのが好きだから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と答えました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも乃木坂でミュージカルが出来るなんて思ってなかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やりたかったことをやらせて頂いてとても幸せです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/01/1158662/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"順位は本当に気にしません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台に上がれるだけでうれしいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ舞台は続くので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出来れば最後まで役を頂けるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気を抜かずに全力でがんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は幕張で個別握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださる方、よろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/01/1158662/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/01/1158662/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オリジナルTシャツ着てみました(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}